+## JSON Output Schema
+
+When using `--json` or `--format json`, `sandbox-ffi` outputs a machine-readable JSON object to stdout adhering to the following stable schema:
+
+```json
+{
+  "version": "1.0.0",
+  "timestamp": "2026-09-18T12:00:00Z",
+  "summary": {
+    "total": 42,
+    "errors": 3,
+    "warnings": 12,
+    "passed": 27
+  },
+  "results": [
+    {
+      "id": "example-drift",
+      "severity": "warning",
+      "message": "Description of the finding",
+      "file": "path/to/file",
+      "line": 42,
+      "suggestion": "Optional fix suggestion"
+    }
+  ]
+}
+```
